{"html":"\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n    <p>Hey there,</p>\n    <p>This is&nbsp;<b>bold</b>&nbsp;text, and&nbsp;<u>underlined</u>&nbsp;is quite nice\n      too. What about&nbsp;<i>italic?</i></p>\n    <p>This is regular size.&nbsp;<font size=\"6\">Larger now.&nbsp;<font size=\"5\">Slightly\n          smaller.<font size=\"4\">&nbsp;Smaller.&nbsp;</font></font></font>Regular\n      again.&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">Very small.&nbsp;<font size=\"1\">Tiny.</font></font></p>\n    <p>Wow and what about emoji?&nbsp;🙂😉😛</p>\n    <h1>Heading 1</h1>\n    <p>That's a big one. <a href=\"https://allodia.eu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Here's a link</a>\n      by the way.</p>\n    <p>And also <font color=\"#ff0000\">different </font><font color=\"#00ff80\">colors&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff00ff\">are&nbsp;<font color=\"#0080ff\">nice&nbsp;<font color=\"#000000\">to play with.</font></font></font></font></p>\n    <p><font color=\"#00ff80\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\"><font color=\"#0080ff\"><font color=\"#000000\">W<font face=\"Comic Sans MS\">hat about a\n                different font? Famous Comic Sans!</font></font></font></font></font></p>\n    Here's a list.\n    <ul>\n      <li>Bullet item 1</li>\n      <ol>\n        <li>Numbered list nested inside it</li>\n        <li>Second numbered list item</li>\n        <li>Third one</li>\n      </ol>\n      <li>Bullet item 2</li>\n      <li>Bullet item 3</li>\n    </ul>\n    <blockquote>\n      <p>Indentation also works!</p>\n      <blockquote>\n        <p>Indented even further.</p>\n      </blockquote>\n    </blockquote>\n    <p>Now back to normal.</p>\n    <p align=\"center\">Even centered text works!</p>\n    <p align=\"left\">Here's an inline image:</p>\n    <p align=\"left\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAgAAAAICAIAAABLbSncAAAAEUlEQVR4nGPQz1+BFTEMLQkAullRgdV+/FYAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" data-cid=\"part1.4SZidU38.gCsiX4EV@test.local\" title=\"This is a tooltip\" alt=\"Alternate text here\" width=\"373\" height=\"240\" class=\"\"></p>\n    <p align=\"left\">And a small table:</p>\n    <table cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td valign=\"top\">Heading 1</td>\n          <td valign=\"top\">Heading 2</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td valign=\"top\">Row&nbsp;2, first cell</td>\n          <td valign=\"top\">Row 2, second cell</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <hr width=\"100%\" size=\"2\">Wow that's a horizontal line right above\n    me.\n    <div class=\"moz-signature\">-- <br>\n      Kind regards, Alice <b>This is my bold signature, pretty cool\n        right?</b></div>\n  \n","name":"thunderbird-new-message","text":"Hey there,\nThis is bold text, and underlined is quite nice too. What about italic?\nThis is regular size. Larger now. Slightly smaller. Smaller. Regular again. Very small. Tiny.\nWow and what about emoji? 🙂😉😛\nHeading 1 That's a big one. Here's a link by the way.\nAnd also different colors are nice to play with.\n What about a different font? Famous Comic Sans!\nHere's a list. Bullet item 1 Numbered list nested inside it Second numbered list item Third one Bullet item 2 Bullet item 3 Indentation also works!\nIndented even further.\nNow back to normal.\nEven centered text works!\nHere's an inline image:\n\nAnd a small table:\nHeading 1 Heading 2 Row 2, first cell Row 2, second cell Wow that's a horizontal line right above me. --\nKind regards, Alice This is my bold signature, pretty cool right?"},
{"html":"\n\n  \n    \n  \n  \n    <p>This is a draft reply from Thunderbird to the baseline message.</p>\n    <div class=\"moz-cite-prefix\">Op 7-1-2026 om 11:00 schreef\n      Newsletter:<br>\n    </div>\n    <blockquote type=\"cite\" cite=\"mid:shared-dup-msgid@example.com\">\n      <pre class=\"moz-quote-pre\">Second of two messages that share the same Message-ID as copy A. Different\nSubject and Date so the two are distinguishable by content the harness controls,\nnever by the server-assigned IMAP UID.\n</pre>\n    </blockquote>\n    <div class=\"moz-signature\">-- <br>\n      Kind regards,\n      Alice\n      <b>This is my bold signature, pretty cool right?</b></div>\n  \n\n","name":"thunderbird-reply","text":"This is a draft reply from Thunderbird to the baseline message.\nOp 7-1-2026 om 11:00 schreef Newsletter:\nSecond of two messages that share the same Message-ID as copy A. Different Subject and Date so the two are distinguishable by content the harness controls, never by the server-assigned IMAP UID. --\nKind regards, Alice This is my bold signature, pretty cool right?"},
{"html":"\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n  \n    <p>This is a forward of the baseline message.</p>\n    <div class=\"moz-forward-container\"><br>\n      <br>\n      -------- Doorgestuurd bericht --------\n      <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" class=\"moz-email-headers-table\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" align=\"RIGHT\">Onderwerp:\n            </th>\n            <td>Harness baseline message</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" align=\"RIGHT\">Datum: </th>\n            <td>Mon, 05 Jan 2026 09:00:00 +0000</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" align=\"RIGHT\">Van: </th>\n            <td>Alice Tester <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:alice@test.local\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&lt;alice@test.local&gt;</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" align=\"RIGHT\">Aan: </th>\n            <td>Bob Tester <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:bob@test.local\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&lt;bob@test.local&gt;</a></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <br>\n      <br>\n      Baseline plaintext message with a unique Message-ID.<br>\n      <br>\n      This one is also COPYed into Archive by the seeder, so the same\n      content has two<br>\n      mailbox memberships (two distinct provider objects) — the IMAP\n      copy invariant.<br>\n    </div>\n  \n\n","name":"thunderbird-forward","text":"This is a forward of the baseline message.\n\n\n-------- Doorgestuurd bericht -------- Onderwerp: Harness baseline message Datum: Mon, 05 Jan 2026 09:00:00 +0000 Van: Alice Tester <alice@test.local> Aan: Bob Tester <bob@test.local>\n\nBaseline plaintext message with a unique Message-ID.\n\nThis one is also COPYed into Archive by the seeder, so the same content has two\nmailbox memberships (two distinct provider objects) — the IMAP copy invariant.\n"},
{"html":"\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n  \n    <p>This is the forwarded CSV message in Thunderbird.</p>\n    <div class=\"moz-forward-container\"><br>\n      <br>\n      -------- Doorgestuurd bericht --------\n      <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" class=\"moz-email-headers-table\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" align=\"RIGHT\">Onderwerp:\n            </th>\n            <td>Message with a text attachment</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" align=\"RIGHT\">Datum: </th>\n            <td>Fri, 09 Jan 2026 14:15:00 +0000</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" align=\"RIGHT\">Van: </th>\n            <td>Reports <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:reports@example.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&lt;reports@example.com&gt;</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th valign=\"BASELINE\" align=\"RIGHT\">Aan: </th>\n            <td>Alice Tester <a class=\"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E\" href=\"mailto:alice@test.local\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&lt;alice@test.local&gt;</a></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <br>\n      <br>\n      Body part. A file attachment follows; attachments span\n      file/item/reference/inline<br>\n      kinds and this protects the file-attachment path end to end.<br>\n      <br>\n    </div>\n  \n","name":"thunderbird-forward-with-file","text":"This is the forwarded CSV message in Thunderbird.\n\n\n-------- Doorgestuurd bericht -------- Onderwerp: Message with a text attachment Datum: Fri, 09 Jan 2026 14:15:00 +0000 Van: Reports <reports@example.com> Aan: Alice Tester <alice@test.local>\n\nBody part. A file attachment follows; attachments span file/item/reference/inline\nkinds and this protects the file-attachment path end to end.\n\n"},
