t{mso-level-number-format:bullet;\n\tmso-level-text:\\F0A7;\n\tmso-level-tab-stop:none;\n\tmso-level-number-position:left;\n\ttext-indent:-.25in;\n\tfont-family:Wingdings;}\n@list l0:level4\n\t{mso-level-number-format:bullet;\n\tmso-level-text:\\F0B7;\n\tmso-level-tab-stop:none;\n\tmso-level-number-position:left;\n\ttext-indent:-.25in;\n\tfont-family:Symbol;}\n@list l0:level5\n\t{mso-level-number-format:bullet;\n\tmso-level-text:o;\n\tmso-level-tab-stop:none;\n\tmso-level-number-position:left;\n\ttext-indent:-.25in;\n\tfont-family:\"Courier New\";}\n@list l0:level6\n\t{mso-level-number-format:bullet;\n\tmso-level-text:\\F0A7;\n\tmso-level-tab-stop:none;\n\tmso-level-number-position:left;\n\ttext-indent:-.25in;\n\tfont-family:Wingdings;}\n@list l0:level7\n\t{mso-level-number-format:bullet;\n\tmso-level-text:\\F0B7;\n\tmso-level-tab-stop:none;\n\tmso-level-number-position:left;\n\ttext-indent:-.25in;\n\tfont-family:Symbol;}\n@list l0:level8\n\t{mso-level-number-format:bullet;\n\tmso-level-text:o;\n\tmso-level-tab-stop:none;\n\tmso-level-number-position:left;\n\ttext-indent:-.25in;\n\tfont-family:\"Courier New\";}\n@list l0:level9\n\t{mso-level-number-format:bullet;\n\tmso-level-text:\\F0A7;\n\tmso-level-tab-stop:none;\n\tmso-level-number-position:left;\n\ttext-indent:-.25in;\n\tfont-family:Wingdings;}\nol\n\t{margin-bottom:0in;}\nul\n\t{margin-bottom:0in;}\n--></style><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Hey there,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">This is <b>bold</b> <span class=\"GramE\">text, and</span> <u>underlined</u> is quite nice too. What about <i>italic?</i></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">This is regular size. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:24.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Larger now. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:20.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Slightly smaller. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Smaller. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Regular again. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Very small. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:8.0pt;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Tiny.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Wow and what about emoji? </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-font-family:Aptos;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-font-family:Aptos;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-char-type:symbol-ext;mso-symbol-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;\">🙂😉😛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"></span></p><h1><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Heading 1</span></h1><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">That’s a big one. <a href=\"https://allodia.eu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Here’s a link</a> by the way.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">And <span class=\"GramE\">also</span> <span style=\"color:#EE0000\">different </span><span style=\"color:#92D050\">colors </span><span style=\"color:#D86ECC;mso-themecolor:accent5;mso-themetint:153;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#D86ECC;mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor:accent5;mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha:100.0%;mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms:&quot;lumm=60000 lumo=40000&quot;\">are </span><span style=\"color:#4E95D9;mso-themecolor:text2;mso-themetint:128;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#4E95D9;mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor:text2;mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha:100.0%;mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms:&quot;lumm=50000 lumo=50000&quot;\">nice </span>to play with.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">What about a different font? Famous Comic Sans!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Here’s a list.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Bullet item 1</span></li><ol style=\"margin-top:0in\" start=\"1\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Numbered list nested inside it</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Second numbered list item</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Third one</span></li></ol><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Bullet item 2</span></li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Bullet item 3</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.25in\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Indentation also works!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:35.4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Indented even further.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Now back to normal.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Even centered text works!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Here’s an inline image:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-no-proof:yes\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"407\" height=\"263\" id=\"Afbeelding_x0020_1\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAgAAAAICAIAAABLbSncAAAAEUlEQVR4nGPQz1+BFTEMLQkAullRgdV+/FYAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\" data-cid=\"image001.png@01DD5B07.F69C9AE0\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">And a small table:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border:none;mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184;mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes\"><td width=\"313\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:234.9pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Heading 1</span></p></td><td width=\"313\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:234.9pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Heading 2</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes\"><td width=\"313\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:234.9pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Row 2, first cell</span></p></td><td width=\"313\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:234.9pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Row 2, second cell</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\"><hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\"></span></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">Wow that’s a horizontal line right above me.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_MailAutoSig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:NL;mso-no-proof:yes\">Kind regards,</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_MailAutoSig\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:NL;mso-no-proof:yes\">Alice</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_MailAutoSig\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:NL;mso-no-proof:yes\">This is my bold signature, pretty cool right?</span></b></span></p><span style=\"mso-bookmark:_MailAutoSig\"></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p></div>","name":"outlook-new-message","text":"Hey there,\r\n\r\nThis is bold text, and underlined is quite nice too. What about italic?\r\n\r\nThis is regular size. Larger now. Slightly smaller. Smaller. Regular again. \r\nVery small. Tiny.\r\n\r\nWow and what about emoji? 🙂😉😛\r\n\r\nHeading 1\r\n\r\nThat’s a big one. Here’s a link <https://allodia.eu/>  by the way.\r\n\r\nAnd also different colors are nice to play with.\r\n\r\nWhat about a different font? Famous Comic Sans!\r\n\r\nHere’s a list.\r\n\r\n*\tBullet item 1\r\n1.\tNumbered list nested inside it\r\n2.\tSecond numbered list item\r\n3.\tThird one\r\n*\tBullet item 2\r\n*\tBullet item 3\r\n\r\nIndentation also works!\r\nIndented even further.\r\n\r\nNow back to normal.\r\n\r\nEven centered text works!\r\n\r\nHere’s an inline image:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd a small table:\r\n\r\n\r\nHeading 1\r\nHeading 2\r\n\r\nRow 2, first cell\r\nRow 2, second cell\r\n\r\n  _____\r\n\r\n\r\nWow that’s a horizontal line right above me.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nAlice\r\nThis is my bold signature, pretty cool right?\r\n\r\n\r\n"},
{"html":"","name":"outlook-reply","text":"This is a draft reply from Outlook to the Harness baseline message.\r\nKind regards,\r\nAlice\r\nThis is my bold signature, pretty cool right?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-----Oorspronkelijk bericht-----\r\nVan: Alice Tester <alice@test.local>\r\nVerzonden: Monday, January 5, 2026 10:00 AM\r\nAan: Bob Tester <bob@test.local>\r\nOnderwerp: Harness baseline message\r\n\r\nBaseline plaintext message with a unique Message-ID.\r\n\r\nThis one is also COPYed into Archive by the seeder, so the same content has \r\ntwo mailbox memberships (two distinct provider objects) — the IMAP copy \r\ninvariant.\r\n"},
{"html":"","name":"outlook-forward","text":"This is a forward of the baseline message.\r\nKind regards,\r\nAlice\r\nThis is my bold signature, pretty cool right?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-----Oorspronkelijk bericht-----\r\nVan: Alice Tester <alice@test.local>\r\nVerzonden: Monday, January 5, 2026 10:00 AM\r\nAan: Bob Tester <bob@test.local>\r\nOnderwerp: Harness baseline message\r\n\r\nBaseline plaintext message with a unique Message-ID.\r\n\r\nThis one is also COPYed into Archive by the seeder, so the same content has \r\ntwo mailbox memberships (two distinct provider objects) — the IMAP copy \r\ninvariant.\r\n"},
{"html":"","name":"outlook-forward-with-file","text":"This is the forwarded CSV message in Outlook.\r\n\r\n-----Oorspronkelijk bericht-----\r\nVan: Reports <reports@example.com>\r\nVerzonden: Friday, January 9, 2026 3:15 PM\r\nAan: Alice Tester <alice@test.local>\r\nOnderwerp: Message with a text attachment\r\n\r\nBody part. A file attachment follows; attachments span \r\nfile/item/reference/inline kinds and this protects the file-attachment path \r\nend to end.\r\n"}
